BEGIN:VCALENDAR
PRODID:-//notapattern//calendar export 1.0//EN
VERSION:2.0
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Blue Man Group: A New Holiday Surprise
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2274897
DTSTAMP:20261016T214116Z
DTSTART:20261113T000000Z
DTEND:20261113T013000Z
SUMMARY:Blue Man Group: A New Holiday Surprise
LOCATION:Lunt-Fontanne Theatre, 205 West 46th Street, New York NY 10036
DESCRIPTION:<p>Blue Man Group, the global entertainment phenomenon that
  became synonymous with Off-Broadway over the course of its record-breaking
  33-year run at the Astor Place Theatre, will make its Broadway debut this
  holiday season with an engagement of Blue Man Group <em>A New Holiday
  Surprise</em>, its first-ever touring holiday production.<br /><br /><em>A
  New Holiday Surprise</em> will feature classic holiday music performed on
  Blue Man Group&rsquo;s iconic custom instruments, while following the Blue
  Men as they discover the traditions, rituals and joyful absurdities of the
  holidays with, of course, a few unexpected detours along the way. As they
  navigate the season, they explore timeless themes of generosity, presence,
  creativity, and human connection. Equal parts hilarious, heartwarming, and
  visually unforgettable, this all new Blue Man experience offers audiences
  a unique holiday tradition that celebrates what brings us together and
  proves that holiday traditions don&rsquo;t always have to go according to
  plan.</p>
END:VEVENT
